      "headline": "Iran-backed Houthis claim missile attack on Saudi Arabia as regional tensions escalate",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "The MoU was meant to reopen the strait after its closure by Iran during the war and pause hostilities for 60 days to give room for negotiations, but active fighting has prevented progress in talks.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-26T08:02:55.983316+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "02fe20694aca758c352822fce6cc6f04132c29502ef881902680c277a239781b",
          "excerpt": "The MoU was meant to reopen the strait after its closure by Iran during the war and pause hostilities for 60 days to give room for negotiations, but active fighting has prevented progress in talks.",
          "sentence_hash": "ab7c6e7ced82be6f6de6d7b3cbedb2e15da9c63ad86751330674d89a1ba65423",
          "anchors": [
            "but",
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "The spokesperson said any country, including Britain and Gulf states, that backed the US in a conflict would be considered a legitimate target, adding that US bombers had recently used British airfields.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-26T08:02:55.983403+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "02fe20694aca758c352822fce6cc6f04132c29502ef881902680c277a239781b",
          "excerpt": "The spokesperson said any country, including Britain and Gulf states, that backed the US in a conflict would be considered a legitimate target, adding that US bombers had recently used British airfields.",
          "sentence_hash": "d20478cd759e8b5518037f58a3da1766bb6621d68ac74e70f244f0b9aa91d76f",
          "anchors": [
            "us",
